Account Transfer Complete

Your Firezone account "<%= @account.slug %>" (<%= @account.id %>) is now in the <%= @region %> region and enabled.

Sign in to the new portal:
<%= @sign_in_url %>

Next steps:
- Create a new token for each Gateway and redeploy it with the new API URL: <%= @api_url %>
- Create new service account tokens for your headless Clients.
- Recreate every API token.
- Reconnect your MCP clients.
- Ask users to sign in again. Links to the old portal redirect to the new one.

Thanks,
The Firezone Team
